; FARO - UI sprites (ui-designer). 8x16 mode: each icon is a PAIR (top at an even index, bottom
; next). Sprites have no white: '.' is transparent, empty insides are light gray '-'.
;
; FIELD HUD (GDD 4.4): OAM 0 = heart at x 4, OAM 1 = bowl at x 14, y 4 (screen pixels, top-left).
; Only 2 pairs (4 tiles) live in sprite VRAM: HUD_SLOT_HEART and HUD_SLOT_BOWL. When a band changes
; the code queues the 2 tiles (32 B) of the new state into its slot through the tile queue
; (gbe_tiles, "icono" in GDD 8.3), so the 7 states below cost ROM only, not VRAM.
; Pair order (code relies on it, APPEND ONLY):
;   HEART_FULL HEART_HALF HEART_EMPTY            (PV >= 50 %, < 50 %, < 25 %)
;   BOWL_FULL BOWL_HALF BOWL_EMPTY BOWL_ZERO     (sac >= 60, 25-59, 1-24, 0)
; The icon is drawn in the top tile (rows 0-6), the bottom tile is empty (HUD at y 4 => the
; visible icon spans y 4-10, inside the first tile row of the screen).

@ HEART_FULL
.##.##..
#-+#++#.
#-++++#.
#+++++#.
.#+++#..
..#+#...
...#....
........
........
........
........
........
........
........
........
........
@ HEART_HALF
.##.##..
#-+#--#.
#-++--#.
#++#--#.
.#+#-#..
..##-#..
...#....
........
........
........
........
........
........
........
........
........
@ HEART_EMPTY
.##.##..
#--#--#.
#-----#.
#-----#.
.#---#..
..#-#...
...#....
........
........
........
........
........
........
........
........
........
@ BOWL_FULL
.-+-++-.
#++++++#
#++++++#
#++++++#
.#++++#.
..####..
.######.
........
........
........
........
........
........
........
........
........
@ BOWL_HALF
........
#------#
#------#
#++++++#
.#++++#.
..####..
.######.
........
........
........
........
........
........
........
........
........
@ BOWL_EMPTY
........
#------#
#------#
#------#
.#----#.
..####..
.######.
........
........
........
........
........
........
........
........
........
@ BOWL_ZERO
#......#
##----##
#-#--#-#
#--##--#
.#-##-#.
..####..
.######.
........
