; ---------------- TITLE: lighthouse beam (title VRAM only). 8 sprites 8x16 in a row at y 52,
; BEAM_0 next to the lantern (x 128) then BEAM_1 at x 120 ... BEAM_7 at x 72: a wedge that widens
; away from the lamp (half height 2 -> 7.5 px). Light gray, dithered edge. Set OAM priority (bit 7)
; so the beam only shows on white: it passes behind the logo, the text and the tower.
